### Get Clientes v4
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Clientes 

### Get Clientes v2
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v2/catalog/Clientes 

### Get Product v4
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Clientes('08c142fa-01b0-441d-b01d-eeaa3291f6f0')

### Get Product v2
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v2/catalog/Clientes?$filter=Name eq 'Milk'

### Create Product v4
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Clientes HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Sample Product",
    "Description": "A detailed description of the product.",
    "ImageUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
    "ReleaseDate": "1992-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "DiscontinuedDate": "1992-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "Price": 1.0,
    "Height": 2.0,
    "Width": 3.0,
    "Depth": 4.0,
    "Quantity": 5,
    "OtherUUID": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}

### Create Product v2
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v2/catalog/Clientes HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"Nombre": "new",
"Apellido": "Doe",
"CorreoElectronico": "john.doe@example.com",
"Telefono": "1234567890",
"Direccion": "123 Main St",
"Ciudad": "Metropolis",
"Pais": "USA",
"FechaRegistro": "2023-01-01",
"Estado": "Activo"
}



### Update Product PATCH v4
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Clientes ('08c142fa-01b0-441d-b01d-eeaa3291f6f0') HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Quantity": "100",
    "Name": "Actualizado v4"
}

